      "claim": "Hostas include many cultivars that are deliberately bred for variegated, white, cream, or gold foliage.",
      "evidence": "Horticultural catalogs, American Hosta Society cultivar lists, and RHS plant registers show dozens of popular variegated and gold‑leaf hostas such as ‘Patriot’, ‘Gold Standard’, ‘Stained Glass’, etc.",
